Z||000012||Eric Marsh||10-31-2000||11:59 PM||||As long as we are talking about home made headers, here is the set I made:<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.hotrodder.com/emarsh/images/engine_rear.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.hotrodder.com/emarsh/images/engine_front.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.hotrodder.com/emarsh/images/headers1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.hotrodder.com/emarsh/images/header2.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.hotrodder.com/emarsh/images/headers3r.jpg"> <P>The primaries are 1 3/4" x 41" long. Design is a 180 degree layout with cyls 1,4,6,7 feeding into one collector and 2,3,5,8 into the other. Welds are not as clean as I might have liked, but this is the first time I've done anything like this.<P>Eric||||reg||6
