Z||000021||Eric Marsh||11-05-2000||12:30 PM||||I think one of the reasons my welds are kinda sloppy is because I chose a Sears Craftman MIG welder. I couldn't quite find the right power. One selection was a little low and the next tended to blow holes in the tubes.<P>I did put a lot of thought into the design of my headers. I think the design is good. The implementation is OK, but I'm sure that if I did it again. I could improve on it.<P>Eric||||reg||1
